{
  "id": "1232",
  "title": "How Many Heads Does a Cow Have?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2021-04-23",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming has some questions for Little Hong about a cow!",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1232/ad95b719753a80f0e0dee7b0e6f35e1eaf276f8c.mp3?1615549436",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "一头牛有几个头？\n\n小明：小红，我问你，一头牛有几个头？\n小红：一个。\n小明：一头牛有几条腿？\n小红：四条。\n小明：一头牛有多少毛？\n小红：牛有那么多毛，我怎么知道有多少毛呀？\n小明：我告诉你，一身毛！\n小红：好吧……\n小明：那我再问你一次，一头牛有多少毛？\n小红：一身毛。\n小明：为（喂）什么？\n小红：我怎么知道为什么呀？\n小明：喂草呀！",
    "traditional": "一頭牛有幾個頭？\n\n小明：小紅，我問你，一頭牛有幾個頭？\n小紅：一個。\n小明：一頭牛有幾條腿？\n小紅：四條。\n小明：一頭牛有多少毛？\n小紅：牛有那麼多毛，我怎麼知道有多少毛呀？\n小明：我告訴你，一身毛！\n小紅：好吧……\n小明：那我再問你一次，一頭牛有多少毛？\n小紅：一身毛。\n小明：為（餵）什麼？\n小紅：我怎麼知道為什麼呀？\n小明：餵草呀！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How Many Heads Does a Cow Have?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明：小红，我问你，一头牛有几个头？",
      "traditional": "小明：小紅，我問你，一頭牛有幾個頭？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xiǎo hóng wǒ wèn nǐ yì tóu niú yǒu jǐ ge tóu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Little Hong, let me ask you, how many heads does a cow have?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小红：一个。",
      "traditional": "小紅：一個。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hóng yí ge",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Hong: One."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明：一头牛有几条腿？",
      "traditional": "小明：一頭牛有幾條腿？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng yì tóu niú yǒu jǐ tiáo tuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: How many legs does a cow have?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小红：四条。",
      "traditional": "小紅：四條。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hóng sì tiáo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Hong: Four."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明：一头牛有多少毛？",
      "traditional": "小明：一頭牛有多少毛？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng yì tóu niú yǒu duō shao máo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: How much hair does a cow have?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小红：牛有那么多毛，我怎么知道有多少毛呀？",
      "traditional": "小紅：牛有那麼多毛，我怎麼知道有多少毛呀？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hóng niú yǒu nà me duō máo wǒ zěn me zhī dào yǒu duō shao máo ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Hong: A cow has so much hair, how would I know how many hairs it has?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明：我告诉你，一身毛！",
      "traditional": "小明：我告訴你，一身毛！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wǒ gào su nǐ yì shēn máo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: I’ll tell you. It has one coat of hair!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小红：好吧……",
      "traditional": "小紅：好吧……",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hóng hǎo ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Hong: Alright …"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小明：那我再问你一次，一头牛有多少毛？",
      "traditional": "小明：那我再問你一次，一頭牛有多少毛？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng nà wǒ zài wèn nǐ yí cì yì tóu niú yǒu duō shao máo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Then I’ll ask you one more time, how much hair does a cow have?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "小红：一身毛。",
      "traditional": "小紅：一身毛。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hóng yì shēn máo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Hong: A coat of hair."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "小明：为（喂）什么？",
      "traditional": "小明：為（餵）什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wèi wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Why? (What do you feed it?)"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "小红：我怎么知道为什么呀？",
      "traditional": "小紅：我怎麼知道為什麼呀？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hóng wǒ zěn me zhī dào wèi shén me ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Hong: How would I know why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "simplified": "小明：喂草呀！",
      "traditional": "小明：餵草呀！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wèi cǎo ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: You feed it grass!"
    }
  ],
